<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Advtech to list subsidiary on S.Africa JSE.</title>
<headline>Advtech to list subsidiary on S.Africa JSE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African education and training firm, Advanced Technical Systems Ltd (Advtech), said on Friday it would list subsidiary Advtech Education Ltd separately on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the listing would be achieved by way of a renounceable rights issue by Advtech Education to Advtech shareholders.</p>
<p>The terms, basis and dates of the rights issue had not yet been determined, it said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
